warning[R0312] (conservative): `Shapes.create` is called at module scope
--> 16:15: runs when the module is first required
  = note: a module's top level runs on the first `require`, before the requirer gets anything back: work there delays every requirer, and nothing declares its order
  = note: valid Luau: which calls a module may make as it loads is this project's choice (`allow` under `[rules.module-scope-computation]` in rime.toml)
  = help: move the call into a function, so it runs when something calls it
